an10.29:14.4 | S: But even the sentient beings who perceive like this decay and perish. | T: But even for beings who are percipient in such a way there is alteration; there is change.
an10.29:14.5 | S: Seeing this, a learned noble disciple grows disillusioned with it. | T: Seeing this thus, the instructed noble disciple becomes disenchanted with it;
